        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The once peaceful land of Ancaria is in grave danger. The evil Ashen empire has enslaved its population and is using the orc-like Grimmoc to wipe out the Seraphim, who swore to protect it. In order to defeat the empire you will have to prove yourself as a warrior by riding terrifying mounts, acquiring earth shattering skills and looting powerful weapons and valuable treasures. Grab your friends and join the resistance!",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "La otrora pacífica tierra de Ancaria corre un grave peligro. El malvado imperio Ashen ha esclavizado a su población y utiliza a los Grimmoc, de aspecto orco, para exterminar a los Seraphim, que juraron protegerla. Para derrotar al imperio deberás demostrar que eres un guerrero montando monturas aterradoras, adquiriendo habilidades demoledoras y saqueando armas poderosas y valiosos tesoros. ¡Reúne a tus amigos y únete a la resistencia!",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
